ature is what makes this  glitch difficult  remember to pause or take breaks if  you're getting tired  once you get to around the 600 weapon  mark you'll want to start paying  attention to link's hands you know  you've achieved super menu overload when  link reads to throw but there's nothing  in his hands  if you see this congratulations you've  finally achieved your goal  in this state there can be varying  effects such as arrows staying in place  body parts that go missing or even  different effects with different  duplicated weapons such as bullet time  on open ground  but now you're wondering how did you do  that throwing trick against the lionel  well prepare to throw even more and  attempt something called throw gatling  first let's explain what we've done so  far with an analogy let's imagine  building a dam with a reservoir  first menu overloading and duplicating  weapons is a damn building process  once the supermenu overload is achieved  the dam is done and ready to hold water  throwing weapons past the 600 weapon  mark throws the item but it never  appears  these invisible weapons are the rising  reservoir filling with water  they're being held in place and staying  until you let go like a real dam if you  throw too many weapons into this buffer  which in this case is 99 additional  weapons the game will crash  aka the dam will break but if you throw  the weapon safely then perform an action  that will release the weapons all at  once  it will be a controlled release of water  through floodgates or in this case  thrown weapons just like a dam releasing  its floodgates  this is called throw gatling like i  stated before this is still inconsistent  and has many underlying rules  but this is the most successful method  perform your superman  overload here then once you know that  it's active run up to the lynel here  make sure to run up to it then pull out  your weapon to make it perform its  explosion attack  don't worry you'll be fine  [Music]  this attacks fireball requires too much  memory to perform  so when it smacks the ground it freezes  unable to move  this is when you start your throw  gatling process by simply throwing two  weapons over and over right next to the  lynel  two savage lino swords seem to have the  least crashes in our experience  remember you cannot throw more than 99  weapons once you've done enough throwing  damage to kill the lynel  hold zl to engage the rook's protection  and unequip whatever equipment you have  on you  sit back and enjoy the fireworks  rest of the world continues to have a  myriad of secrets even four years after  release  and the discovery of new glitches keeps  the game constantly fresh  even if some of these finds are  painstaking if you enjoyed this or at  least found it interesting give us a  like we continue to show what new things  you can do breath of the wild to this  day  and for everything else stay tuned right  here on gamespot  you

